=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ STEWARD @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt Steward @VERSION@ for OpenVMS (vms-steward): browser-based system management, early test
1 'NOTICE
