1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [STEWARD.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for Steward (vms-steward)
    Steward runs behind lighttpd (vms-lighttpd), which must be installed and set up.
    Once, as SYSTEM: create the service account, data directory, gateway secret and
    the lighttpd rules (site settings in SYS$MANAGER:STEWARD$CONFIG.COM):
    $ @STEWARD$ROOT:[COM]STEWARD$CONFIGURE
    Then add the include line it prints to lighttpd's LIGHTTPD.CONF, and:
    $ @STEWARD$ROOT:[COM]STEWARD$CONTROL START
    $ @VMSLIGHTTPD$ROOT:[COM]VMSLIGHTTPD$CONTROL RESTART
    At boot, add to SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM (after TCP/IP and SSL3):
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:STEWARD$STARTUP.COM
    At shutdown, add to SYS$MANAGER:SYSHUTDWN.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:STEWARD$SHUTDOWN.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE STEWARD stops the pool and deassigns STEWARD$ROOT; the data
directory (sessions, audit log), the account and the site settings are kept.
